* START-HISTORY:
* 20 Aug 26 Windows port - refuse a trailing token instead of discarding it.
*           "SET.PASSWORD DON hunter2" used to prompt anyway and say nothing,
*           so the password reached the command stack for no purpose.
* 19 Aug 26 Windows port - SDSYS accounts and $cred are lower case on disk.
